Comment: 0,0:00:05.07,0:00:05.07,Usaghi Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Typesetting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.49,0:00:04.75,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Futon, clothes, shoes, toothbrush...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.51,0:00:07.08,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:08.27,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.61,0:00:15.05,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Don't disappear on me all of a sudden!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.05,0:00:16.60,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:18.09,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.07,0:00:22.62,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, can you get me the green one?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.39,0:00:36.34,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.20,0:00:44.31,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's dangerous not to hold hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:48.71,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.16,0:02:46.91,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Were there always this many parents with kids here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.07,0:02:49.53,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I want that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.39,0:02:55.53,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This one?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.53,0:02:56.19,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.19,0:03:00.41,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm... Sure, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.03,0:03:02.59,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's your size?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.59,0:03:03.78,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.15,0:03:10.17,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.49,0:03:13.86,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.83,0:03:17.29,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Where do I start measuring from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.29,0:03:18.77,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.77,0:03:20.42,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Stop flapping your arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.42,0:03:21.94,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What else do you wear?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.94,0:03:26.18,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Pajamas! Underwear! Shirts! Socks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.19,0:03:36.32,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What about skirts?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:38.19,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You've only picked out trousers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.19,0:03:41.13,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,We're not allowed to wear skirts in nursery school.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.43,0:03:43.56,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.24,0:03:50.00,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nursery school?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.63,0:03:52.82,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I completely forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.82,0:03:54.96,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow's Monday!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.50,0:04:01.99,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.99,0:04:05.29,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little further, so bear with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.29,0:04:06.43,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.00,0:04:09.39,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.39,0:04:12.58,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be home soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.58,0:04:14.06,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.06,0:04:15.98,Usaghi Main I,girl on tv,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.31,0:04:21.33,Usaghi Main I,girl on tv,0000,0000,0000,,Are you ditching work again? You're useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.33,0:04:24.85,Usaghi Main I,guy on tv,0000,0000,0000,,You keep bringing stuff I don't need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.85,0:04:26.38,Usaghi Main I,guy on tv,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:28.83,Usaghi Main I,kid on tv,0000,0000,0000,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.79,0:04:34.38,Usaghi Main I,kid on tv,0000,0000,0000,,Don't touch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.38,0:04:35.95,Usaghi Main I,kid on tv,0000,0000,0000,,Let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.95,0:04:37.71,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.71,0:04:40.61,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, Maeda residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.61,0:04:45.36,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, my heartfelt condolences for your sudden loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.36,0:04:47.68,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.13,0:04:51.53,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko-san, it's Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.53,0:04:54.76,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Right, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.04,0:04:57.80,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, Haruko?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.80,0:05:00.40,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I forgot to ask your cellphone number.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.40,0:05:01.45,Usaghi Main I,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.45,0:05:04.49,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Um, how do you enroll someone in nursery school?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.17,0:05:06.93,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Nursery school...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.37,0:05:11.45,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,You really took Rin-chan home?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.31,0:05:14.81,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure that's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.81,0:05:16.42,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:18.96,Usaghi Main I,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean, "for now"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.96,0:05:22.73,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I can't take a leave from work tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.73,0:05:24.34,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So what procedure should I take?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.34,0:05:27.98,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's not something you can do that easily, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.98,0:05:29.41,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Can't you do something about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.41,0:05:31.31,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you say so...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.75,0:05:34.89,Usaghi Main I,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,For starters, consult the city administration—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.89,0:05:36.67,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's Sunday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.26,0:05:38.27,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.27,0:05:40.55,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.27,0:05:41.14,Usaghi Main Top,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, is that Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.14,0:05:42.74,Usaghi Main Top,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.58,0:05:44.86,Usaghi Main Top,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.55,0:05:41.58,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.58,0:05:44.86,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Reina, please! This is important!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.32,0:05:48.19,Usaghi Main I,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,There's this thing called an "emergency nursery school."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.19,0:05:50.45,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Emergency nursery school, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.22,0:05:50.45,Usaghi Main Top,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.85,0:05:52.64,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.64,0:05:54.57,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? Dai-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.95,0:05:57.13,Usaghi Main Top,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! Rin-chan! Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.57,0:05:56.42,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.13,0:05:59.71,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm almost done, so wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:00.89,Usaghi Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,No waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.89,0:06:03.32,Usaghi Main,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko-san, I'll turn the heat off for the miso soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.32,0:06:04.67,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Right, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.01,0:06:08.58,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, you seem to be busy so I'll call back later—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:09.34,Usaghi Main Top,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.42,0:06:17.30,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, there aren't many...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.30,0:06:19.77,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like I'm going to spend twice as much time commuting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.60,0:06:24.19,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Yeah. I'm doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.70,0:06:26.73,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This one's pretty close,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.73,0:06:28.70,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but I can't leave the office by 6:00 PM.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.89,0:06:28.70,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Yeah. Let's play together again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.17,0:06:33.08,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, bye-bye, Reina-chan. See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.63,0:06:37.64,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This one seems good,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.64,0:06:40.92,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but they'll only accept kids on an emergency basis for 10 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:42.80,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bath...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.03,0:06:46.71,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Can you wait a little longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.20,0:07:07.03,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.44,0:07:09.67,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.92,0:07:13.63,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.48,0:07:23.16,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you sleep on my side?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.89,0:07:27.09,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The futon is strangely warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.82,0:07:30.55,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Take this off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.82,0:07:34.46,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.19,0:07:41.85,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,About the nursery school we're going to today...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.38,0:07:51.51,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Time to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.49,0:07:51.51,Usaghi Main Top,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Time to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.98,0:07:56.68,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't put your elbows on the table while eating!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.45,0:07:59.49,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.38,0:08:09.64,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, the nursery school we're going to now is only temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.64,0:08:10.34,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Temporary?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.72,0:08:14.31,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, it's only until we find a place you can attend formally.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.31,0:08:16.30,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What does "formally" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.38,0:08:24.99,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Like something proper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.81,0:08:27.70,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.24,0:08:31.33,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,My hair is fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.75,0:08:37.91,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.20,0:08:40.79,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.30,0:08:53.99,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.99,0:08:55.51,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:00.93,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.15,0:09:04.48,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Put me down! Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.18,0:09:07.26,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.45,0:09:10.71,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You think it'd be embarrassing if the other kids saw that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.90,0:09:16.86,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.54,0:09:22.04,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.97,0:09:24.44,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.50,0:09:32.90,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, I'll leave her in your care.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.90,0:09:35.51,Usaghi Main,teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Sure. See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.50,0:09:59.96,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't make that face!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.55,0:10:02.85,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be gone during the daytime,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.85,0:10:04.87,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but I'll come back as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.76,0:10:07.17,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.41,0:10:13.96,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Pinky swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:15.36,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If I lie,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.36,0:10:18.47,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll swallow a thousand needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.47,0:10:20.57,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Goddammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.57,0:10:22.41,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.16,0:10:25.09,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's not how the song goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.39,0:10:28.39,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.39,0:10:29.85,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wait for me, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.02,0:10:36.36,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:40.03,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't think about your feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.01,0:10:44.62,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Your mother's position and Grandpa's lifespan...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.18,0:10:48.12,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Those aren't under your control, and yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.94,0:10:52.53,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,the sad fact is that you were left all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:56.34,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you think I was going to leave you too?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.02,0:11:00.55,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.55,0:11:02.31,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I won't let it happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.27,0:11:14.90,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Read this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.25,0:11:17.44,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:39.72,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san, let's go get lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.74,0:11:42.64,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:44.18,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I need to leave early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.76,0:11:48.41,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,I see. I'll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.76,0:11:51.17,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Working hard from the start of the month, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:54.42,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.53,0:12:09.75,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Take a picture of this sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.75,0:12:10.44,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.44,0:12:14.44,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san! You have a call on line 4 about the shipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.44,0:12:15.50,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:18.87,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, this is Kawachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.77,0:12:31.06,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.41,0:12:32.98,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.98,0:12:34.27,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.17,0:12:38.18,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Let's keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.18,0:12:39.16,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.95,0:12:48.72,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.72,0:12:50.87,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.39,0:12:57.08,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,You're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.08,0:12:59.51,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about that. Put your coat on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.51,0:13:00.74,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.31,0:13:08.50,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, don't break it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.50,0:13:09.38,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.38,0:13:10.80,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.51,0:13:14.86,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.47,0:13:26.70,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.70,0:13:28.68,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.68,0:13:29.37,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.03,0:13:32.66,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,It's Miyata-san from Mitsutomo Trading.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.78,0:13:36.67,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.30,0:13:39.05,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, this is Kawachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.05,0:13:40.55,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for buying from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.85,0:13:56.27,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, this is Kawachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.20,0:13:58.49,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.76,0:14:00.19,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.89,0:14:04.38,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I'll be able to leave the office in a bit, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.38,0:14:05.57,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:50.73,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The nursery school... is so far!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.18,0:15:04.80,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Sorry I'm late!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.52,0:15:12.20,Usaghi Main,teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.52,0:15:15.56,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.53,0:15:17.57,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.88,0:15:28.31,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Potato?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.31,0:15:29.45,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It looks delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.01,0:15:31.59,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's burdock!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.96,0:15:45.02,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A thousand needles...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.67,0:15:50.30,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I swallowed them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.79,0:16:22.46,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll leave this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.91,0:16:26.92,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san, you need to sign this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.31,0:17:02.40,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I doubt it'll ever happen, but
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.40,0:17:05.25,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,what will I do if I get a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.71,0:17:17.29,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.29,0:17:19.31,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.22,0:17:22.77,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.40,0:17:27.27,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi, weren't you supposed to send this out yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.63,0:17:31.48,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.06,0:17:34.54,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,This is unusual for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:35.95,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.95,0:17:38.64,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,I already apologized to the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.64,0:17:41.18,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I'll contact him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.72,0:17:47.45,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while since we've gone drinking. What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.45,0:17:49.88,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.88,0:17:51.84,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,What about tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.04,0:17:53.64,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow's no good either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.57,0:17:59.80,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I get it. Good for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.86,0:18:22.16,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.53,0:18:26.37,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.99,0:18:41.20,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.20,0:18:42.89,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.44,0:19:01.76,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, run away from Moon-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.76,0:19:05.95,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.15,0:19:37.03,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There's no end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.61,0:19:45.50,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How much longer can I stand to do this lifestyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.60,0:19:56.72,Usaghi Main I,lady,0000,0000,0000,,These belong to Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.72,0:19:59.27,Usaghi Main I,lady,0000,0000,0000,,This is all she has.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.27,0:20:02.26,Usaghi Main I,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Her birth certificate and other important documents are in here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.62,0:20:09.01,Usaghi Main I,lady,0000,0000,0000,,Even if it's for a short time, raising a kid is no joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.01,0:20:11.70,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin is the one who has it hard, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.10,0:20:16.98,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I'll just take a little peek.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.77,0:20:23.52,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She still has the same mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.06,0:20:27.77,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The relatives...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.77,0:20:31.42,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,They talk about you like you're a horrible villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.94,0:20:36.38,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder who the real villain is... Masako-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.34,0:22:16.42,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.42,0:22:18.06,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you feeling sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.56,0:22:21.56,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, why are you sleeping on that side now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.58,0:22:31.78,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,M-Me?! Is it me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.70,0:22:36.08,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.69,0:22:45.03,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.03,0:22:47.21,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's just sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.55,0:22:49.51,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Help me get the sheets off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.97,0:22:51.76,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I said it's sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.76,0:22:54.23,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't I just say that too?!
